# A table whose entry for one key is an optional field: indexing by that key gives no value.
-- source.cue --
k!: "x" | "y"
-- target.cue --
n!: int
-- lens.cue --
v0_0: _
v1_0: {n: {x?: 1, y: 2}[v0_0.k]}
-- out --
not total
v1_0.n indexes a table by v0_0.k, which may be "x", for which the table has no entry (rule table-key-missing) @ lens.cue:2:11
